>
  <section class="brx-sec brx-tint" id="cost">
    <div class="brx-wrap">
      <h2>How much does a bathroom installation cost in Formby?</h2>
      <p class="brx-answer">A full new bathroom in Formby starts from £4,995, supplied and fitted, including VAT. An en-suite starts from £4,495.</p>
      <div class="brx-table-wrap">
        <table class="brx-table">
          <thead><tr><th>Job</th><th>Price, inc VAT</th><th>Typical time</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td><strong>Cloakroom or WC</strong></td><td>from £2,495</td><td>A few days</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>Bath to shower conversion</strong></td><td>from £2,395</td><td>2 to 3 days</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>En-suite shower room</strong></td><td>from £4,495</td><td>Set out in your quote</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>Full bathroom, supplied and fitted</strong></td><td>from £4,995</td><td>5 to 7 working days</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>Labour-only full refit (your own suite)</strong></td><td>from £2,750</td><td>5 to 7 working days</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>Unvented cylinder for an en-suite</strong></td><td>from £1,450</td><td>Done with the en-suite</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <h3>What changes the price in Formby?</h3>
      <ul class="sg-ticks">
        <li><strong>Room size.</strong> Bigger Formby bathrooms mean more wall and floor to tile.</li>
        <li><strong>The tiles and suite you pick.</strong> Big format tiles and premium fittings cost more.</li>
        <li><strong>Hot water.</strong> A new en-suite may need an unvented cylinder for good pressure.</li>
        <li><strong>Moving things.</strong> Moving a toilet or waste costs more than keeping it in place.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Only need a new shower? See our <a href="/showers-liverpool">shower installation</a> prices, from £375 fitted.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="brx-sec" id="included">
    <div class="brx-wrap">
      <h2>What is included in a Formby bathroom installation?</h2>
      <p class="brx-answer">Everything from the strip-out to the final clean. Your quote lists what is in and what is not.</p>
      <ul class="sg-ticks">
        <li><strong>Strip-out and disposal.</strong> The old suite and tiles leave with us. No skip on your drive.</li>
        <li><strong>All plumbing.</strong> New hot, cold and waste pipes to every fitting.</li>
        <li><strong>Tiling.</strong> James's team does the tiling, with the wet areas waterproofed first. Big format tiles suit larger rooms.</li>
        <li><strong>The suite.</strong> Bath or shower, toilet, basin, taps and valves, fitted and sealed.</li>
        <li><strong>Electrics.</strong> Lights, extractor fans and shower circuits by our partner firm <a href="https://www.idealelectricalsolutions.co.uk">Ideal Electrical Solutions</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Making good.</strong> We test every joint, remove grout haze, polish the chrome and clean before we leave.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>You can buy your own tiles or suite. If you supply the suite, the labour-only price is from £2,750.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="brx-sec brx-tint" id="selling">
    <div class="brx-wrap">
      <h2>Is a new bathroom worth it before selling in Formby?</h2>
      <p class="brx-answer">Often, yes. A tired bathroom is one of the things buyers notice most. A fresh one can stop it being used to push your price down.</p>
      <p>Formby has many four and five bedroom detached homes. Buyers at this level expect a modern main bathroom. Many also expect an en-suite off the main bedroom.</p>
      <p>A dated bathroom gives a buyer, or their surveyor, a reason to offer less. A new one takes that reason away.</p>
      <h3>How we help if you are selling</h3>
      <ul class="sg-ticks">
        <li>Free visit, with honest advice on what is worth doing</li>
        <li>Fixed written price, so you know the cost before you list</li>
        <li>Work planned around your listing date</li>
        <li>Room left clean and ready for photos</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Sometimes a bath to shower conversion or a new suite is enough. We will say so if it is.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="brx-sec" id="how">
    <div class="brx-wrap">
      <h2>How long does a bathroom installation take in Formby?</h2>
      <p class="brx-answer">A full bathroom usually takes 5 to 7 working days. A bath to shower conversion takes 2 to 3 days.</p>
      <ol class="sg-steps">
        <li><strong>Free home visit (about 45 minutes).</strong> We measure up and check the pipes and waste. For an en-suite, we check your hot water system too.</li>
        <li><strong>Fixed written price.</strong> The full spec, written down. What is included is listed, and so is what is not.</li>
        <li><strong>Day 1: strip-out.</strong> The old bathroom comes out and leaves with us.</li>
        <li><strong>Days 1 to 3: first fix.</strong> New pipes and waste go in. Our partner electricians do any wiring. If we find rot or a leak, we show you and price it first.</li>
        <li><strong>Days 3 to 5: walls and floor.</strong> Boarding, waterproofing and tiling, or wall panels.</li>
        <li><strong>Final days: fit and hand over.</strong> The suite goes in. We test every joint, seal it all and clean the room.</li>
      </ol>
      <p>Bigger rooms and lots of tiling take longer. Your quote gives you the dates.</p>
      <div class="brx-cta">
        <p><strong>Want a price for your Formby bathroom?</strong> Book a free home visit. No pressure to book.</p>
        <a href={TEL} class="brx-btn">Call {PHONE}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="brx-sec brx-tint" id="en-suite">
    <div class="brx-wrap">
      <h2>Can you add an en-suite or a bathroom in an extension?</h2>
      <p class="brx-answer">Yes. En-suites start from £4,495. We also fit bathrooms in new extensions and loft conversions, working with your builder.</p>
      <h3>En-suites with strong showers</h3>
      <p>Most people want a mains pressure shower in a new en-suite. An old tank in the loft may not feed two showers at once. An unvented cylinder fixes this, with strong hot water to every bathroom.</p>
      <p>Our engineers are G3 qualified to fit and test them. We can do the en-suite and the cylinder as one project, with one price. See our <a href="/hot-water-cylinders-formby">hot water cylinders in Formby</a>, from £1,450.</p>
      <h3>Extensions and loft conversions</h3>
      <p>Many Formby homes are being extended or renovated. We work alongside your builder or architect.</p>
      <ul class="sg-ticks">
        <li><strong>During the build.</strong> We do the first fix plumbing while the walls are open.</li>
        <li><strong>Once the room is ready.</strong> We come back to tile and fit the bathroom.</li>
        <li><strong>One price.</strong> All the plumbing and tiling is fixed in writing.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="brx-sec" id="which">
    <div class="brx-wrap">
      <h2>Which option is right for me?</h2>
      <p class="brx-answer">Start with what is wrong with the room now. If only the bath is the problem, a conversion may be all you need.</p>
      <div class="sg-cols">
        <div class="sg-box">
          <h3>Bath to shower, from £2,395</h3>
          <p>Best if you rarely use the bath, or getting in and out is hard. Done in 2 to 3 days.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sg-box">
          <h3>Full bathroom, from £4,995</h3>
          <p>Best if the suite, tiles and pipes are all tired. The whole room is new.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sg-box">
          <h3>En-suite, from £4,495</h3>
          <p>A shower room off the main bedroom. Popular in larger Formby homes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sg-box">
          <h3>Cloakroom or WC, from £2,495</h3>
          <p>A toilet and basin downstairs. Handy for guests and busy family homes.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p style="margin-top:1rem;"><strong>Not sure?</strong> We will tell you honestly at the free visit, even if the cheaper option is the right one.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="brx-sec brx-tint" id="postcodes">
    <div class="brx-wrap">
      <h2>Do you cover all of Formby and nearby Sefton?</h2>
      <p class="brx-answer">Yes. We fit bathrooms across Formby L37 and the towns around it.</p>
      <div class="brx-table-wrap">
        <table class="brx-table">
          <thead><tr><th>Area</th><th>Places and postcodes</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td><strong>Formby</strong></td><td>Formby Village L37, Freshfield L37, Formby Point L37</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>Maghull and Lydiate</strong></td><td>Maghull L31, Lydiate L31, Aughton L39</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>Crosby and Litherland</strong></td><td>Crosby L23, Waterloo L22, Litherland L21</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p>Crosby and Waterloo have many Victorian and Edwardian homes. We know these well from our Liverpool work. Travel is included in your quote.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="brx-sec" id="why">
    <div class="brx-wrap">
      <h2>Why choose us as your Formby bathroom fitters?</h2>
      <p class="brx-answer">One team for plumbing and tiling, a fixed price in writing, and a 12-month guarantee on our work.</p>
      <div class="sg-cols">
        <figure class="sg-photo">
          <picture>
            <source type="image/webp" srcset="/images/jobs/bathroom-bath-shower-fitted-480.webp 480w, /images/jobs/bathroom-bath-shower-fitted-960.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 400px" />
            <img src="/images/jobs/bathroom-bath-shower-fitted-960.jpg" alt="New bath and shower fitted by our bathroom team" width="960" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </picture>
          <figcaption>A real job: new bath and shower fitted.</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="sg-photo">
          <picture>
            <source type="image/webp" srcset="/images/jobs/shower-room-fitted-480.webp 480w, /images/jobs/shower-room-fitted-960.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 400px" />
            <img src="/images/jobs/shower-room-fitted-960.jpg" alt="Shower room fitted by our team" width="960" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </picture>
          <figcaption>A real job: shower room fitted.</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
      <ul class="sg-ticks">
        <li><strong>One team.</strong> Plumbing and tiling by James's team. No gap while you wait for a tiler.</li>
        <li><strong>G3 qualified.</strong> We can fit the unvented cylinder your en-suite needs.</li>
        <li><strong>Fixed price in writing.</strong> If we find something behind the old bath, we price it before we touch it.</li>
        <li><strong>Guaranteed.</strong> 12 months on our work, and £2 million public liability insurance.</li>
        <li><strong>Tidy.</strong> We clean up and take all the rubbish away with us.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</ServiceGuide>
